# Desktop Native Core (Rust & Tauri v2)

When modifying native Rust code, adhere to:
- [.agents/rules/rust-tauri.md](../../.agents/rules/rust-tauri.md): Rust 2021+, `#![deny(clippy::unwrap_used)]`, separate window capability files (`main-window.json` vs `hud-window.json`), SQLite WAL and native backup API.
- [.agents/rules/security-isolation.md](../../.agents/rules/security-isolation.md): Capability boundaries and loopback token authentication.
